<title>UK: Keller wins 5.8 mln stg German contract.</title>
<headline>Keller wins 5.8 mln stg German contract.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>British engineering company Keller Group Plc said on Friday that it has been awarded a 5.9 million stg specialist grouting contract in Berlin, Germany.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that the work will be carried out on the site of new government offices which are built close to the river Spree.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
